---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '../lib/siteConfig';

/**
 * Medical disclaimer (§6, Phase C7; launch form 2026-08-04) — the
 * sitewide expansion of DisclaimerBlock's vetted wording. NOTE: the
 * standard boilerplate vocabulary of this genre is banned by the claims
 * linter by design; this page uses the safe lexicon. Counsel reviews
 * post-launch (operator acceptance, DECISIONS 2026-08-04).
 */
---

<LegalLayout
  heading="Medical Disclaimer"
  title="Medical Disclaimer | Needle Girlie"
  description="Medical disclaimer for needlegirlie.com: general information, not medical advice."
>
  <p>
    The content of this website, every page, description, and answer,
    is general information and education. It is not medical advice, and
    it does not replace an in-person evaluation by a licensed clinician.
  </p>

  <h2>No provider–patient relationship</h2>
  <p>
    Reading this website, or contacting the practice through it, does not
    create a provider–patient relationship with Amy Palacios, FNP. That
    relationship begins with a consultation and an individual evaluation.
  </p>

  <h2>Individual decisions, individual experiences</h2>
  <p>
    Whether any treatment fits your needs is decided together with Amy
    Palacios, FNP, during a consultation, never by a website. Individual
    experiences vary, and no outcome is promised or implied anywhere on
    this website.
  </p>

  <h2>Reading is not a substitute</h2>
  <p>
    Information on this website cannot account for any individual
    medical history, medications, or circumstances. Decisions about care
    belong in a consultation with a licensed clinician who knows them.
  </p>

  <h2>Prescription medications</h2>
  <p>
    Some services described on this website involve prescription
    medications. They are offered only under clinician supervision,
    following an individual evaluation.
  </p>

  <h2>Product names and manufacturer materials</h2>
  <p>
    This website names the products and devices used in the practice
    and, in places, carries manufacturer-produced materials.
    Manufacturer materials speak for the manufacturer; the practice's
    own guidance is given in consultation.
  </p>

  <h2>Emergencies</h2>
  <p>
    This website is not for emergencies. If you are experiencing a
    medical emergency, call 911 or go to the nearest emergency room.
  </p>

  <h2>Questions</h2>
  <p>
    Questions about anything on this website can be directed to Needle
    Girlie by phone at <a href={siteConfig.phoneTel}>{siteConfig.phone}</a>
    — or better, asked in a consultation.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
